---
import Refugios from "../../../layouts/Refugios.astro";

/**
 * Ask for a code.
 *
 * **Prerendered, and this one is load-bearing.** ADR 0013: "Sign-in adds no server-rendered
 * route. The form is static and posts to an action endpoint." A static form is also the
 * cheapest possible way to satisfy ADR 0008's identical-response rule, because a page that
 * renders nothing about the submitted address cannot leak anything about it — there is no
 * server-side branch here to get wrong.
 *
 * It says up front that the answer will be the same either way. That is not a disclaimer
 * bolted on: a shelter whose address has a typo in it would otherwise sit waiting for mail
 * that is never coming, and telling it the page cannot distinguish the two cases is what
 * lets it think to check the spelling.
 */
---

<Refugios title="Entrar" heading="Entra a tu refugio">
  <p>
    Escribe el correo del refugio y te mandamos un código de seis dígitos. No hay
    contraseña.
  </p>

  <form method="post" action="/api/refugios/codigo">
    <p>
      <label for="accountEmail">Correo del refugio</label><br />
      <input
        id="accountEmail"
        name="accountEmail"
        type="email"
        required
        maxlength="200"
        autocomplete="email"
      />
    </p>
    <p><button type="submit">Mándame el código</button></p>
  </form>

  <p data-testid="identical-response-notice">
    <!--
      The enumeration rule, stated to the shelter rather than only enforced. ADR 0008
      requires this form to answer identically whether or not the address is registered, so
      the page cannot tell a shelter that its address is unknown — and a shelter that does
      not know that would read the silence as a platform fault instead of a typo.
    -->
    Esta página responde igual si el correo está registrado y si no lo está, para que nadie
    pueda averiguar cuáles refugios están en Pawster. Si no te llega nada en unos minutos,
    revisa que el correo esté bien escrito.
  </p>

  <p>¿Todavía no tienes refugio aquí? <a href="/refugios/registro">Regístralo</a>.</p>
</Refugios>
